<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Except for section 3, this Act is deemed to have come into operation on 27 February 2020 and shall continue to remain in operation until 31 December 2022. Interpretation"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@> .
