<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection (1) shall have effect for the period from the date this Act is published in the Gazette until 31 December 2022 and during such period the Loan (Local) (Statutory Ceiling for Borrowing) and Government Funding (Statutory Ceiling of Moneys Received) Order 2009 is suspended."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@> .
