<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of this section, “Gross Domestic Product of Malaysia” means the latest Gross Domestic Product of Malaysia confirmed by the Minister. Establishment of COVID-19 Fund"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@> .
