<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A fund to be known as the COVID-19 Fund is established and shall be specified in and incorporated into the Second Schedule to the Financial Procedure Act 1957 [Act 61]."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@> .
