<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding subsection 5(1) of the Loan (Local) Act 1959 and section 4 of the Government Funding Act 1983, any sum raised under subsection 3(1) of the Loan (Local) Act 1959 and any money received under subsection 3(1) of the Government Funding Act 1983 may be paid into the COVID-19 Fund for the purposes of its application under section 5. Application of COVID-19 Fund"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@> .
