<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "limit or suspend the amount to be applied and appropriated for the purposes of any programme; or"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@> .
