<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "direct any sum appropriated for a programme to be appropriated in aid of any other programme for which the sum appropriated may be deficient a further amount out of any surplus from the first mentioned programme."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@/~cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/eng@> .
